 "text": "# Navs e abas\n\nType: Bootstrap drop-in. Write standard Bootstrap 5.3.8 markup. The kit only changes the look; no new classes are needed.\nSection: Componentes\nHuman version (rendered examples): componentes/navs-tabs.html\nProse language: Brazilian Portuguese. Code, class names and identifier tables are language-neutral.\n\nnav-tabs e nav-pills viram as abas do jogo: horizontais em pílula e, com flex-column, verticais em escada.\n\n## Abas horizontais\n\n```\n<ul class=\"nav nav-tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n  <li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n    <button\n      class=\"nav-link active\"\n      data-bs-toggle=\"tab\"\n      data-bs-target=\"#nt1\"\n      type=\"button\"\n      role=\"tab\"\n      aria-selected=\"true\">\n      Geral\n    </button>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n    <button\n      class=\"nav-link\"\n      data-bs-toggle=\"tab\"\n      data-bs-target=\"#nt2\"\n      type=\"button\"\n      role=\"tab\"\n      aria-selected=\"false\">\n      Itens\n    </button>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n    <button class=\"nav-link disabled\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-disabled=\"true\">\n      Desabilitada\n    </button>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"tab-content p-2\">\n  <div class=\"tab-pane fade show active\" id=\"nt1\" role=\"tabpanel\">Conteúdo geral.</div>\n  <div class=\"tab-pane fade\" id=\"nt2\" role=\"tabpanel\">Conteúdo dos itens.</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Abas verticais (escada)\n\n```\n<div class=\"d-flex align-items-start\" style=\"max-width:420px\">\n  <ul class=\"nav nav-pills flex-column\" role=\"tablist\">\n    <li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n      <button\n        class=\"nav-link active\"\n        data-bs-toggle=\"pill\"\n        data-bs-target=\"#nv1\"\n        type=\"button\"\n        role=\"tab\">\n        Status\n      </button>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n      <button\n        class=\"nav-link\"\n        data-bs-toggle=\"pill\"\n        data-bs-target=\"#nv2\"\n        type=\"button\"\n        role=\"tab\">\n        Equip\n      </button>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n      <button\n        class=\"nav-link\"\n        data-bs-toggle=\"pill\"\n        data-bs-target=\"#nv3\"\n        type=\"button\"\n        role=\"tab\">\n        Skill\n      </button>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n  <div class=\"tab-content flex-grow-1 p-2\">\n    <div class=\"tab-pane fade show active\" id=\"nv1\" role=\"tabpanel\">Painel de status.</div>\n    <div class=\"tab-pane fade\" id=\"nv2\" role=\"tabpanel\">Painel de equipamentos.</div>\n    <div class=\"tab-pane fade\" id=\"nv3\" role=\"tabpanel\">Painel de habilidades.</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Nav simples\n\n```\n<ul class=\"nav\">\n  <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link active\" href=\"#\">Ativo</a></li>\n  <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#\">Link</a></li>\n  <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link disabled\" aria-disabled=\"true\">Off</a></li>\n</ul>\n```\n\nNote\n\nSem Bootstrap, o kit tem as abas cro-tabs e cro-tabs-v com data-cro-tabs. Veja Abas cro-*.\n\n## Outras variações\n\n```\n<ul class=\"nav nav-underline mb-2\">\n  <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link active\" href=\"#\">nav-underline</a></li>\n  <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#\">B</a></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"nav nav-tabs nav-fill mb-2\">\n  <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link active\" href=\"#\">nav-fill</a></li>\n  <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#\">B</a></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"nav nav-pills nav-justified\">\n  <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link active\" href=\"#\">nav-justified</a></li>\n  <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#\">B</a></li>\n</ul>\n```\n\n- nav-fill: cada item ocupa o espaço proporcional ao conteúdo. nav-justified: todos com largura igual.\n- nav-underline: derivação do Bootstrap (sublinhado no ativo).\n- Em cards: card-header-tabs e card-header-pills (veja Card).\n« Navbar · Offcanvas »\n",
